5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. Let us observe the silence before the storm breaks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer the quiet. It allows for clearer thought and less noise.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi. I'm really excited to start this game with you all!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I will watch closely. Trust is a fragile thing in this circle.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello! I'm May. Let's make this a fun and lively discussion, shall we?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom lies in patience. We must not rush to judgment without evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. Rushing leads to errors. Let the facts speak for themselves.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I agree with Servas! We should be careful. Who do you all think is suspicious?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Suspicion is a tool, not a weapon. Use it wisely, Yumi.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,I think we should just enjoy the process. No need to be so serious yet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,The night holds secrets. Let us prepare our minds for what comes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will keep my distance. It is safer that way for everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I feel a bit nervous, but I'm ready to help! Let's stick together.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Stick together? In a game of wolves? That is a dangerous notion.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"Victoria, don't be so paranoid. We're all friends here, right?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Friends or foes, the truth will reveal itself. Rest well, all.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Goodnight. I will read a bit before sleep.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! Hope we have a peaceful night.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Peace is an illusion. Stay alert.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,Sweet dreams! See you all in the morning.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
