31,1,1,talk,Servas,,The night has passed. Who among us carries the shadow of the wolf?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have no information. I remain an observer of the group's dynamics.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm a villager! I just want to find the werewolf and keep us safe.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have my suspicions, but I will not reveal my method yet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm just a regular villager too! Let's focus on the evidence, not guesses.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Yumi, your eagerness is noted. But eagerness can also be a mask.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I find Yumi's energy refreshing. It contrasts with the tension here.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm just trying to help! Why is everyone so suspicious of me?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Suspicion is natural. Jonathan, your calmness is also suspicious in its own way.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,"Victoria, you're being too harsh. Let's not turn on each other so quickly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,The wolf hides in plain sight. We must look beyond the surface.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Surface appearances are often the most deceptive.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I think May is being too friendly. It feels a bit off, doesn't it?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,May's charm is a weapon. Do not be fooled by her smile.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,"Wow, harsh. I'm just trying to be nice. Why is everyone so mean?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,Kindness can be a shield. But so can cruelty. We must decide.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will vote for the one who seems least trustworthy to me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm going to vote for May. She seems too perfect.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I concur. May's behavior is inconsistent with a true villager.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,I can't believe you're all voting for me. I'm innocent!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
